  user_input {
    user_response: "Please help me build the Frontend for an internal Admin/Superadmin dashboard from scratch. My teammates are using PostgreSQL, and I am using Next.js (React) with Node.js logic.The Stack:Framework: Next.js (App Router)Database/ORM: PostgreSQL with PrismaStyling: Tailwind CSSWhat I need from you:Project Setup: Give me the terminal commands to initialize a Next.js project with Tailwind and Prisma.Folder Structure: Organize the project so the React frontend components are separate from the Prisma database logic.Frontend Layout: Create a professional dashboard sidebar and a \"User Management\" table using Tailwind CSS.Data Connection: Show me how to use a Next.js Server Component to fetch a list of users from the database via Prisma and display them in my React table.Role Logic: Ensure the UI can hide or show certain buttons (like \"Delete User\") based on whether the role is Admin or Superadmin.Please start by giving me the installation commands and the initial Layout.tsx and Page.tsx code. take your time making it, i need functions to work and ensure the API layer includes secure server-side role validation."
    items {
      text: "Please help me build the Frontend for an internal Admin/Superadmin dashboard from scratch. My teammates are using PostgreSQL, and I am using Next.js (React) with Node.js logic.The Stack:Framework: Next.js (App Router)Database/ORM: PostgreSQL with PrismaStyling: Tailwind CSSWhat I need from you:Project Setup: Give me the terminal commands to initialize a Next.js project with Tailwind and Prisma.Folder Structure: Organize the project so the React frontend components are separate from the Prisma database logic.Frontend Layout: Create a professional dashboard sidebar and a \"User Management\" table using Tailwind CSS.Data Connection: Show me how to use a Next.js Server Component to fetch a list of users from the database via Prisma and display them in my React table.Role Logic: Ensure the UI can hide or show certain buttons (like \"Delete User\") based on whether the role is Admin or Superadmin.Please start by giving me the installation commands and the initial Layout.tsx and Page.tsx code. take your time making it, i need functions to work and ensure the API layer includes secure server-side role validation."
